    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Conditional.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Conditional</code></a> that checks whether a default health indicator is\nenabled. Matches if the value of the <code>management.health.&lt;name&gt;.enabled</code> property\nis <code>true</code>. Otherwise, matches if the value of the\n<code>management.health.defaults.enabled</code> property is <code>true</code> or if it is not\nconfigured.",
